-- ===========================================================================
-- ShipSense — seed data  (GENERATED by db/build_seed.py — do not edit by hand)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Source: Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset
--   (Kaggle: olistbr/brazilian-ecommerce, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).
--
-- Hubs       : 27 Brazilian federative units; lat/lng are the mean of the
--              real geolocation points per state.
-- Routes     : real land-border adjacency; distance_km = great-circle between
--              state centroids; avg_travel_hours = distance / 60 km/h
--              (a transparent estimate, the only non-measured value here).
-- Shipments  : a real, reproducible sample of actual Olist orders — real
--              purchase/estimate/delivery timestamps, weights and freight.
-- ===========================================================================

